{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17285","headline":"送崔谕德致政东归 · 权德舆","name":"送崔谕德致政东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子坐法宫，诏书下江东。\n懿此嘉遯士，蒲车赴丘中。\n褐衣入承明，朴略多古风。\n直道侍太子，昌言沃宸聪。\n嵓居四十年，心与鸥鸟同。\n一朝受恩泽，自说如池龙。\n乞骸归故山，累疏明深衷。\n大君不夺志，命锡忽以崇。\n旭旦出国门，轻装若秋蓬。\n家依白云峤，手植丹桂丛。\n竹斋引寒泉，霞月相玲珑。\n旷然解赤绶，去逐冥冥鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}